		"name": "Geepay E-Commerce API",
		"description": "Multi-tenant African marketplace API - v2\n\nImport Geepay-Ecom.postman_environment.json and select **Geepay Local**.\n\n**User types:** customer | merchant | system_admin\n**Merchant member roles:** owner > admin > manager > staff > viewer\n**Platform admin roles:** super_admin > operations > finance > support > viewer\n\n**Quick flows (use folder collections):**\n- Geepay - Merchant Onboard Flow\n- Geepay - Order and Payment Flow\n- Geepay - Customer Ledger Flow\n\n**Store typing:**\n- `store_type` — business vertical (BARBERSHOP, RESTAURANT, BOUTIQUE, …)\n- `store_category` — order workflow (auto-derived from store_type unless overridden)\n\nUSSD: *{ussd_code}*{order_number}*{total_major}#",
